Status: DONE (deployed and technically verified; new visual approval not claimed)
Milestone: Show physical cartridge insertion during emulator loading
Dependencies: 06_3D_TABLETOP, 08_POWER_LIFECYCLE, 10_DARK_ROOM, 11_STARTUP_AND_PERSISTENT_POWER
Purpose: Make loading visible as an original cartridge entering the handheld's
  top slot, without delaying native startup or changing power/save semantics.

Tasks:
- [x] Reuse original cartridge geometry as a retained child of the handheld.
- [x] Animate one downward insertion when a different cartridge is loaded.
- [x] Frame and light the insertion while keeping the shell above the tabletop.
- [x] Retain the seated cartridge during play, inspection, errors and power cycles.
- [x] Respect reduced motion and restore an off console with its cartridge seated.
- [x] Verify desktop/phone real loading, refresh, physical motion and camera return.
- [x] Deploy and independently verify live before final public documentation.

Acceptance criteria:
- A visible 3D cartridge slides downward into the top slot during real loading.
- The cartridge remains attached after seating and follows the handheld.
- The loading pose fits desktop/phone viewports and clears the actual tabletop.
- Camera and handheld return to the ordinary held pose after insertion.
- Already-seated power cycles do not fabricate removal/reinsertion.
- Reduced motion seats immediately. Insertion does not switch the console on.
- Long downloads do not loop insertion or display fabricated download progress.
- Native startup is not delayed to wait for the physical animation.
- Existing battery-only power boot, checkpoints, CRT and settings remain intact.

Completion evidence:
- Syntax/build and all ten units PASS.
- Final explicit-software CDN, cold-boot and desktop/phone insertion cases:
  four PASS in 1.5m, retaining exact battery/checkpoint assertions.
- Source 6f8d2652e6fee36d316f585f1baf242394540227 / Pages 41766869711:
  build, both complete browser shards (27 total) and actual deployment PASS.
- Fresh live checks match all 23 exact public assets and pass both real loading
  insertion cases in 30.6s, including desktop refresh and real native demo output.
- Original live desktop capture reviewed; no commercial-ROM testing resumed.

Completion log:
- 2026-11-04: First raised-only cartridge was outside useful lamp illumination.
  Lower the loading pose into the actual beam instead of adding hidden fill.
  A larger lowering intersected the table; final .95-unit lowering preserves
  positive mesh/table clearance. Slide local Y=3.8 to 1.52 once, then stay seated.
- 2026-11-04: Pages 41765659405 passed 26/27 cases, including both new insertion
  cases, but failed a second power-off click; deployment was skipped.
  Its trace shows autosave disabling the switch between actionability checking
  and click dispatch. Isolate that separately tested timer through normal UI in
  the cold-boot fixture; retain every save assertion and add no-reinsertion checks.
- 2026-11-04: Corrected full release and fresh live verification succeed before
  final documentation. Technical completion is not inferred human approval.
